1.1.0 2026-10-14
  - Regenerated all BIDS recordings with the corrected MOABB Zhou2020 loader
    (https://github.com/NeuroTechX/moabb/pull/1269, issue
    https://github.com/NeuroTechX/moabb/issues/1120).
    Subjects 1-12 (41-electrode cap): versions up to 1.0.3 named the channels
    EEG1..EEG41 and kept only the first 41 of the 45 data columns, so hEOG,
    vEOG, M1 and M2 were stored as EEG27-EEG30 and POz, PO4, Oz and F6 were
    missing. Files now have 45 channels: the 41 EEG electrodes with their real
    names (F3 ... F6), hEOG/vEOG typed EOG and the M1/M2 mastoids typed MISC,
    plus electrode positions (space-CapTrak electrodes/coordsystem files).
    Subjects 13-20 (26 electrodes): hEOG/vEOG added as EOG channels (28 per
    file). Sampling rate (500 Hz), EEG values, events (33,534) and the list of
    recordings are unchanged.
  - README regenerated from the corrected loader metadata (channel names,
    IEEE DataPort reference doi:10.21227/f1c7-7x89);
    code/Zhou2020.metadata.yaml updated.
  - sourcedata/ unchanged.
